Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1300
Set Height 520
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Type "TERMINALTUI_GRAPHICS=off COLORTERM=truecolor npx tsx src/cli/index.ts dev demos/odyssey/config.ts"
Enter
Sleep 15s
Enter
